{"title":"fire & storm days","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/fire-storm-days","date":1789987661000,"content":"<figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9be22589-04e7-48fe-82c7-a1a7fb26506c/fire+and+storm.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9be22589-04e7-48fe-82c7-a1a7fb26506c/fire+and+storm.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9be22589-04e7-48fe-82c7-a1a7fb26506c/fire+and+storm.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9be22589-04e7-48fe-82c7-a1a7fb26506c/fire+and+storm.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9be22589-04e7-48fe-82c7-a1a7fb26506c/fire+and+storm.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9be22589-04e7-48fe-82c7-a1a7fb26506c/fire+and+storm.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9be22589-04e7-48fe-82c7-a1a7fb26506c/fire+and+storm.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9be22589-04e7-48fe-82c7-a1a7fb26506c/fire+and+storm.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n          \n          <figcaption>\n            <p>completed: august 18 2026</p>\n          </figcaption>\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>visit my </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>sketchbook</strong></a><strong> | more </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>visual art</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n \n\n\n  <p>I have accessed this place in my visual practice in which I don’t plan, or sketch, or think about what to paint; I just turn inwards and see an image inside of me, and then I let my hands find their way on the page, like tugging a thread, and letting everything unspool. </p><p>the days I painted this, I felt inside of me: a thrashing storm, hurricane winds, a burning forest fire, shards of trees. after I gave it space on the page, I felt lighter, relieved, like I could breath better. </p><p>I painted these with two or three 22” min evening time spells — a time witchery practice I’ll write about, soon. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bdaa1943-3091-42bc-9c4c-fb5d928a30ea/fire+and+storm+3.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bdaa1943-3091-42bc-9c4c-fb5d928a30ea/fire+and+storm+3.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bdaa1943-3091-42bc-9c4c-fb5d928a30ea/fire+and+storm+3.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bdaa1943-3091-42bc-9c4c-fb5d928a30ea/fire+and+storm+3.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content